<title>UK: South Africa mark Eurobond due Monday - traders.</title>
<headline>South Africa mark Eurobond due Monday - traders.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's mark Eurobond, likely to be a 500 million mark seven-year deal, is due to be launched on Monday, syndicate managers said on Friday.</p>
<p>Spread talk was 130 to 150 basis points over Bunds.</p>
<p>Joint lead managers are Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p>It will be South Africa's second mark-denominated Eurobond. A 400 million mark 10.25 percent deal issued in 1991 is due to mature next month.</p>
<p>-- Aline van Duyn, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
